      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِيحٌ رَيْدَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A wind blowing gently;</i> as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَيْدَانَةٌ</span></b>  (T, S, M, A, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَادَةٌ</span></b> : (S, M, A,
K:) or the first, as some say, <i>that blows much.</i>
(M.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَادٌ</span> in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رود</span>.]

